    <div class="reveal" style="--d:1"><span class="lp-num">Stage 2</span><h3>Custom Alert Logic Tuning</h3><p>This is where DIY systems fail. We customize the G-force and AI sensitivity thresholds to match your specific vehicle weights and operating environments. A &lsquo;Harsh Braking&rsquo; alert for a hazmat tanker is different than for a last-mile delivery van. We ensure that your safety managers only see the signals that require action, effectively eliminating alert fatigue and improving manager morale. We move your safety program from &lsquo;Quantity of Data&rsquo; to &lsquo;Quality of Action.&rsquo;</p></div>
